PASS  identity channel (beta=-1.5, gamma=0.4): E[y^2] = beta^2 + gamma^2   | MC 2.40977 vs 2.41000
  a 256-channel skip: E_identity = 266.92
PASS  the denominator of eq. 19 is now COMPUTED from BN stats   | sqrt(gamma^2 + beta^2) summed over ambient channels — no knob to tune
